# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.gemini/
**/.gemini/
.agents/
**/.agents/
.dotnet/
**/.dotnet/
.dotnet*
.dotnet*/
.dotnet_temp/
*.dotnetUserLevelCache
*.toolpath.sentinel
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.claude/
.copilot/

